US National Library of Medicine, MedlinePlus. Appendix A: Word Parts and What They Mean. English.

[Authorized source](https://medlineplus.gov/appendixa.html).

A lookup for word roots, directions, body parts, procedures, and modifiers. Use it to understand vocabulary, not to derive a diagnosis or assume that a historical word fully explains a biological mechanism.

